[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Card From Jimmy]
[00:01.00]Lesson 101 | 第101课
[00:03.63]A card from Jimmy | 吉米的明信片
[00:06.82]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:12.40]Does grandmother seem pleased to get a card from Jimmy? Why/Why not? | 奶奶收到吉米的明信片似乎很高兴吗？为什么/为什么不？
[00:22.46]Read Jimmy's card to me please, Penny. | 请把吉米的明信片读给我听，潘妮。
[00:28.32]'I have just arrived in Scotland and I'm staying at a Youth Hostel.' | “我刚到苏格兰，住在青年旅社。”
[00:36.56]Eh? | 嗯？
[00:38.06]He says he's just arrived in Scotland. | 他说他刚到苏格兰。
[00:44.02]He says he's staying at a Youth Hostel. | 他说他住在青年旅社。
[00:49.10]You know he's a member of the Y.H.A. | 你知道他是青年旅社协会的成员。
[00:55.95]The what? | 什么？
[00:57.72]The Y.H.A., Mum. | 青年旅社协会，妈妈。
[01:01.06]The Youth Hostels Association. | 青年旅社协会。
[01:05.22]What else does he say? | 他还说了些什么？
[01:08.72]'I'll write a letter soon. | “我很快会写信的。
[01:12.26]I hope you are all well.' | 希望你们都好。”
[01:15.81]What? Speak up, Penny. | 什么？大声点，潘妮。
[01:19.80]I'm afraid I can't hear you. | 我恐怕听不清你说什么。
[01:23.35]He says he'll write a letter soon. | 他说他很快会写信。
[01:27.96]He hopes we are all well. | 他希望我们都好。
[01:32.01]'Love, Jimmy.' | “爱你的，吉米。”
[01:35.06]Is that all? | 就这些吗？
[01:37.54]He doesn't say very much, does he? | 他没说多少，是吧？
[01:41.99]He can't write very much on a card, Mum. | 他在明信片上写不了很多，妈妈。